				</header>

				
									<p class="content-item__excerpt">Muddy Waters is short NVIDIA (NVDA). A class action suit filed against Super Micro Computer Inc. in October alleges that former SMCI Chief Growth Officer, a woman named Cenly Chen, “managed [SMCI’s] acquisition of GPU chips from NVIDIA” and “decided how to distribute [NVDA GPUs] among Super Micro’s&hellip; <a class="content-item__more" href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/mw-short-nvda/" title="MW is Short NVIDIA: More Questions About China (NVDA US)">more <i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i></a></p>
							</div>
		</div>
	</article><!-- #post-3087 -->
	<article id="post-3073" class="content-item post-3073 reports type-reports status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry company-114">
		<div class="content-item__wrapper">
							<a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/oct-13/" title="MW is Short Edison International (US EIX)" class="content-item__image-wrapper">
					<img width="500" height="138" src="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Edison_logo.jpg" class="content-item__image wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Edison_logo.jpg 500w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Edison_logo-300x83.jpg 300w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Edison_logo-400x110.jpg 400w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" />				</a>
						<div class="content-item__text-wrapper">
									<div class="content-item__taxonomy">
						<a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/company/2026/" rel="tag">2026</a>					</div>
				
				<header class="content-item__header">
					<h3 class="content-item__title"><a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/oct-13/" title="MW is Short Edison International (US EIX)" class="content-item__title-link">MW is Short Edison International (US EIX)</a></h3>
				</header>

				
									<p class="content-item__excerpt">Newly assembled evidence drawn entirely from Southern California Edison’s own regulatory filings indicates the utility consciously disregarded public safety when it failed to consider de-energizing the four 220-kilovolt Transmission Circuits running through Eaton Canyon on the evening of January 7,&hellip; <a class="content-item__more" href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/oct-13/" title="MW is Short Edison International (US EIX)">more <i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i></a></p>
							</div>
		</div>
	</article><!-- #post-3073 -->
	<article id="post-3056" class="content-item post-3056 reports type-reports status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry company-114">
		<div class="content-item__wrapper">
							<a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/mw-is-short-ensg/" title="MW is Short Ensign (NASDAQ: ENSG)" class="content-item__image-wrapper">
					<img width="500" height="158" src="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ensg_logo.png" class="content-item__image wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ensg_logo.png 500w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ensg_logo-300x95.png 300w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ensg_logo-400x126.png 400w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" />				</a>
						<div class="content-item__text-wrapper">
