						<a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/company/2026/" rel="tag">2026</a>					</div>
				
				<header class="content-item__header">
					<h3 class="content-item__title"><a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/mw-is-short-ensg/" title="MW is Short Ensign (NASDAQ: ENSG)" class="content-item__title-link">MW is Short Ensign (NASDAQ: ENSG)</a></h3>
				</header>

				
									<p class="content-item__excerpt">We conclude that ENSG engages in a systematic scheme at an estimated ~20 of Skilled Nursing Facilities (SNFs) to rent the licenses of Administrators who are not generally present at, nor actually managing, the facilities. Ensign enters into consulting agreements with these nominal Administrators tha&hellip; <a class="content-item__more" href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/mw-is-short-ensg/" title="MW is Short Ensign (NASDAQ: ENSG)">more <i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i></a></p>
							</div>
		</div>
	</article><!-- #post-3056 -->
	<article id="post-3043" class="content-item post-3043 reports type-reports status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry company-114">
		<div class="content-item__wrapper">
							<a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/mw-is-short-srad/" title="MW is Short Sportradar Group AG (SRAD US)" class="content-item__image-wrapper">
					<img width="500" height="181" src="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sportradar_logo.png" class="content-item__image wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sportradar_logo.png 500w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sportradar_logo-300x109.png 300w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sportradar_logo-400x145.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" />				</a>
