				</header>

				
									<p class="content-item__excerpt">We are short Sportradar Group AG.
At the ICE 2026 gaming conference in Barcelona, our investigators posed as operators of a startup sportsbook. We told SRAD's sales team — repeatedly and explicitly — that our target markets were Vietnam, Thailand, Indonesia, and China. Every one of these countries&hellip; <a class="content-item__more" href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/mw-is-short-srad/" title="MW is Short Sportradar Group AG (SRAD US)">more <i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i></a></p>
							</div>
