							<a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/mw-sofi-borrowingsales-0330/" title="How SOFI’s Borrowing Money and Booking it as a Sale Enriched Management (SOFI US)" class="content-item__image-wrapper">
					<img width="500" height="280" src="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/sofi-logo.png" class="content-item__image wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/sofi-logo.png 500w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/sofi-logo-300x168.png 300w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/sofi-logo-400x224.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" />				</a>
