					<h3 class="content-item__title"><a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/sofi-11-questions/" title="SOFI: Eleven Questions, Zero Answers (SOFI US)" class="content-item__title-link">SOFI: Eleven Questions, Zero Answers (SOFI US)</a></h3>
				</header>

				
									<p class="content-item__excerpt">Muddy Waters is short SOFI. On March 17, we published a 28-page report concluding that SOFI’s 2025 Adjusted EBITDA is inflated by approximately 90%. SOFI’s response was a press release that did not address a single factual claim. CEO Noto purchased $500,000 of stock—roughly 0.86% of the $58.3 millio&hellip; <a class="content-item__more" href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/sofi-11-questions/" title="SOFI: Eleven Questions, Zero Answers (SOFI US)">more <i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i></a></p>
							</div>
		</div>
	</article><!-- #post-3023 -->
	<article id="post-2913" class="content-item post-2913 reports type-reports status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry company-114">
		<div class="content-item__wrapper">
							<a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/mw-short-0317/" title="MW is Short SoFi Technologies, Inc. (SOFI US)" class="content-item__image-wrapper">
					<img width="500" height="280" src="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/sofi-logo.png" class="content-item__image wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/sofi-logo.png 500w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/sofi-logo-300x168.png 300w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/sofi-logo-400x224.png 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" />				</a>
						<div class="content-item__text-wrapper">
