						<a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/company/2026/" rel="tag">2026</a>					</div>
				
				<header class="content-item__header">
					<h3 class="content-item__title"><a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/mw-short-0317/" title="MW is Short SoFi Technologies, Inc. (SOFI US)" class="content-item__title-link">MW is Short SoFi Technologies, Inc. (SOFI US)</a></h3>
				</header>

				
									<p class="content-item__excerpt">SOFI is a financial engineering treadmill, not a healthily growing origination business. SOFI shareholders are incessantly diluted so management can hit bonus targets through GE Capital-style loan marks and Enron-esque off-balance-sheet structures that disguise borrowings as revenue.

SOFI also ap&hellip; <a class="content-item__more" href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2026/mw-short-0317/" title="MW is Short SoFi Technologies, Inc. (SOFI US)">more <i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i></a></p>
							</div>
		</div>
	</article><!-- #post-2913 -->
	<article id="post-2882" class="content-item post-2882 reports type-reports status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry company-113">
		<div class="content-item__wrapper">
							<a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2025/app-persistent-lies/" title="APP’s Persistent Lies, Denying Use of Persistent IDs (APP US)" class="content-item__image-wrapper">
					<img width="500" height="133" src="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/app_logo_whitebg.jpg" class="content-item__image wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/app_logo_whitebg.jpg 500w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/app_logo_whitebg-300x80.jpg 300w, https://muddywatersresearch.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/app_logo_whitebg-400x106.jpg 400w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" />				</a>
						<div class="content-item__text-wrapper">
