					<h3 class="content-item__title"><a href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2025/app-persistent-lies/" title="APP’s Persistent Lies, Denying Use of Persistent IDs (APP US)" class="content-item__title-link">APP’s Persistent Lies, Denying Use of Persistent IDs (APP US)</a></h3>
				</header>

				
									<p class="content-item__excerpt">Muddy Waters is short AppLovin (APP). APP’s CEO and CTO responded to our initial report (dated Match 27, 2025) with demonstrably false statements. In contrast to its CEO and CTO’s claims, APP continues to use persistent identifiers that violate users’ privacy and partner platforms’ terms of service.&hellip; <a class="content-item__more" href="https://muddywatersresearch.com/research/2025/app-persistent-lies/" title="APP’s Persistent Lies, Denying Use of Persistent IDs (APP US)">more <i class="fa fa-angle-right"></i></a></p>
